s. Preserve the context calculation, blend, masks, fallback, and scoring methods in both arms.\"}","mechanism":"The incumbent comparison tests practical value of learnable featurewise compression. The generated scalar-scale control tests whether feature specificity adds value beyond learning a shared compression strength. Fixed-state checks establish the intended algebraic contrast; independently trained ranking comparisons remain provisional.","predicted_observations":["At initialization, both proposed arms reproduce the incumbent's scale-four compression.","After unequal scale parameters are set, the candidate compresses features differently while the generated control applies one shared scale.","If feature-specific compression helps ranking, candidate mean HR@10 exceeds 0.60425 and exceeds the generated control under the frozen protocol."]},"design_hash":"c09aea5d02b1a69e79d607bbf25725649fde5f0fa86054ac9f3dcaffb6bad537","mechanism_status":"unknown","next_step":"Assess whether the implemented contrast isolates the proposed mechanism; design a discriminating follow-up for competing explanations.","qualification":"Paired development observation, not causal proof or independent replication.","slices":[{"candidate_minus_control":-0.007000000000000006,"dataset":"Movies_and_TV","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":0.0030000000000000027,"dataset":"Industrial_and_Scientific","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":0.0020000000000000018,"dataset":"Electronics","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":0.014000000000000012,"dataset":"CDs_and_Vinyl","seed":42}],"source_hashes":{"amazon-next-v8-round-1-control-1":"476ecc734dcc059fbdde19e242248321ba093c766b8f3091c30fd7a3b7580e8e","amazon-next-v9-round-2-control-1":"3a756027869bb4a20fed6f0e08af20c8bea16736fea0abaadcd1d9467157b6df","amazon-next-v9-round-2-model":"b5464daed436527c4fc06640d5344708aff85462749f50d9ab69681709b108b3"}}],"metric":"HR@10","minimum_effect":0,"model_minus_baseline":{"amazon-next-v9-round-2-control-1":-0.014000